683
01:14:08,860 --> 01:14:17,880
Those are recommendations on policies focusing on those marginalized women and gender-based violence

684
01:14:17,880 --> 01:14:23,720
and national mechanism for promoting gender equality, and the last part provides responses

685
01:14:23,720 --> 01:14:31,239
and explanations regarding previous concluding observations and current issues related to NHRC.

686
01:14:31,840 --> 01:14:40,140
So first, I would like to start with gender-based violence and also our observations and assessment

687
01:14:40,140 --> 01:14:45,960
and recommendations regarding difficulties in getting judicial remedy for sexual assault cases.

688
01:14:46,500 --> 01:14:51,659
Following our recommendations, the elements constituting offenses against sexual autonomy

689
01:14:51,659 --> 01:14:58,819
should be amended from against the victim's will to active consent model, and also we urge

690
01:14:58,819 --> 01:15:04,060
judicial personnel should also be encouraged to seek diverse evidence during the investigation

691
01:15:04,060 --> 01:15:10,819
and trial process, and also regarding the Stalking and Harassment and Prevention Act,

692
01:15:11,260 --> 01:15:14,060
which was an act that enforced four years ago.

693
01:15:14,460 --> 01:15:16,939
So our recommendations are as follows.

694
01:15:17,279 --> 01:15:22,579
First, we need to improve the professional knowledge and skills of police officers,

695
01:15:22,779 --> 01:15:28,800
and also judicial organs should expedite the processing and trial of civil protection

696
01:15:28,800 --> 01:15:35,279
orders. Police and health authorities should coordinate as soon as possible to improve

697
01:15:35,279 --> 01:15:42,800
treatment plans for perpetrators because in the past two years, there were only three cases,

698
01:15:43,420 --> 01:15:50,699
so that performance really warrants a further investigation, and then also

699
01:15:51,680 --> 01:15:56,319
we don't have sufficient protection for adult victims in sexual image crime cases.

700
01:15:56,319 --> 01:16:03,720
An increasing complexity of digital gender-based violence we recommend. First, we need to amend

701
01:16:03,720 --> 01:16:10,399
relevant laws and regulations, and also we need to impose responsibilities on internet service

702
01:16:10,399 --> 01:16:16,899
providers. Secondly, we should have dedicated task forces within the prosecution and police

703
01:16:17,800 --> 01:16:23,539
to actively investigate and deter illegal sexual image crimes against adults.

704
01:16:24,260 --> 01:16:32,800
And moving on, we would like to talk about hate speeches against marginalized

705
01:16:32,800 --> 01:16:38,180
and disadvantaged women. We think that the government should actively enact

706
01:16:38,180 --> 01:16:44,539
Anti-Discrimination Act. We have been waiting for two years without any results,

707
01:16:44,819 --> 01:16:51,180
and also hate speech should be clearly defined, and also there should be a tiered handling

708
01:16:51,180 --> 01:16:58,579
mechanism to be designed. And then regarding the plight of women in rural areas and indigenous

709
01:16:58,579 --> 01:17:04,739
women and women with disabilities, we recommend the shortage and uneven distribution of public

710
01:17:04,739 --> 01:17:10,380
child care and women's health care services in rural and indigenous areas should be improved,

711
01:17:11,819 --> 01:17:18,800
and also we should improve resources and information regarding accessibility

712
01:17:18,800 --> 01:17:26,119
of medical environments and facilities, and also we should improve accessible restrooms,

713
01:17:26,520 --> 01:17:34,560
lactation rooms, and other spaces and facilities. And moving on to migrant female workers and their

714
01:17:34,560 --> 01:17:42,239
children, and we would also like to point out and remind that those children born to

715
01:17:43,240 --> 01:17:53,439
account for or without documented migrant workers, there are altogether 4,173 children,

716
01:17:54,199 --> 01:18:01,140
and then there are still 887 of them are still missing and leaving their nationality status

717
01:18:01,140 --> 01:18:07,500
and protection of rights unclear. And furthermore, the actual number of non-citizen children whose

718
01:18:07,500 --> 01:18:13,199
births were not reported remain unknown, although the government has formulated guidelines for

719
01:18:13,199 --> 01:18:19,300
medical and welfare subsidies for children born to unaccounted for migrant workers. However,

720
01:18:19,460 --> 01:18:25,800
the utilization rate is very low, and also we recommend institutional deficiencies regarding

721
01:18:25,800 --> 01:18:30,420
the insufficient protection of female migrant workers' labor rights should be improved

722
01:18:30,420 --> 01:18:37,060
at the source to ensure they enjoy the same labor human rights protection as domestic workers,

723
01:18:37,060 --> 01:18:43,779
and also we need to have regular collaboration mechanism to be established with migrant workers'

724
01:18:44,140 --> 01:18:49,260
human rights organizations to review and continuously improve the accessibility and

725
01:18:49,260 --> 01:18:55,340
effectiveness of medical welfare, education, and child care support measures for undocumented

726
01:18:55,340 --> 01:19:02,859
children, ensuring no child suffers discrimination due to their parents' identity or residency status.

727
01:19:02,859 --> 01:19:07,840
And also, with regard to the institutional discrimination

728
01:19:07,840 --> 01:19:16,800
faced by divorced women and LGBTQI-plus individuals, the systematic discrimination

729
01:19:18,219 --> 01:19:27,359
in regard to that, we recommend we should amend laws to accelerate relaxed requirements for

730
01:19:28,159 --> 01:19:35,100
child-rearing, and the right to claim should not be extinguished upon remarriage. Pensions from

731
01:19:35,100 --> 01:19:41,399
various professions should also be included in scope of claims for the distribution of remaining

732
01:19:41,399 --> 01:19:47,399
marital property, and the artificial reproduction system should be amended to include lesbian

733
01:19:47,399 --> 01:19:54,739
spouses. The mandatory surgery requirement for gender marker change registration should be

734
01:19:54,739 --> 01:20:02,859
We would like to point this out that this is the requirement of CEDAW and also the two covenants

735
01:20:02,859 --> 01:20:09,319
observation observations. This is a reminder that keep coming out from the conclusion

736
01:20:09,319 --> 01:20:18,340
observations. However, it's not yet implemented. And next, I would like to give the floor to

737
