739
01:20:39,239 --> 01:20:48,180
And now I would like to talk about our mechanisms that advance national gender equality,

740
01:20:49,060 --> 01:20:57,460
and also I would like to respond to our list from point three to four, and also the recommendation.

741
01:20:58,640 --> 01:21:08,560
So first, with regard to the mechanism by which our country wants to facilitate and advance gender

742
01:21:08,560 --> 01:21:14,359
equality, the mechanism by which the presidential office promotes and implements CEDAW in

743
01:21:14,359 --> 01:21:21,340
