744
01:21:21,340 --> 01:21:28,479
established by the presidential office, which also suffered gender imbalance. And also we would like

745
01:21:28,479 --> 01:21:37,539
to talk about the control which our NHRC sets that for the operation of the gender equality

746
01:21:37,539 --> 01:21:46,079
mechanisms across the five yuans that the information should be fully disclosed. And

747
01:21:46,079 --> 01:21:52,199
we would like to remind when it comes to executive yuans that the proportion of female cabinet

748
01:21:52,199 --> 01:21:58,220
members remain persistently low. Furthermore, several laws and regulations that do not comply

749
01:21:58,220 --> 01:22:07,140
with CEDAW such as a genetic health act have long failed to be amended. So we would like to urge

750
01:22:07,140 --> 01:22:15,220
executive yuans to amend these regulations. In regard to legislative yuans, that NHRC recommends

751
01:22:15,220 --> 01:22:20,319
that mechanisms should be established to ensure that all bills and deliberations comply with the

752
01:22:20,319 --> 01:22:25,800
standards and human rights conventions, including CEDAW. Regarding the judicial yuans, we recommend

753
01:22:25,800 --> 01:22:31,260
a gender-friendly judicial system should be promoted, the effectiveness of monitoring and

754
01:22:31,260 --> 01:22:36,840
accountability mechanisms should be evaluated, and internal gender discrimination and violence

755
01:22:36,840 --> 01:22:42,079
should be addressed. And we also have a recommendation that effective measures should

756
01:22:42,079 --> 01:22:47,000
be developed to increase quantity and quality of CEDAW citations in judicial judgments.

757
01:22:47,539 --> 01:22:55,380
And we think that all statutory functions and powers of NHRC require decisions by the committee

758
01:22:55,380 --> 01:23:01,640
plenary meeting. However, the investigations initiated and recommendations made by the NHRC

759
01:23:01,640 --> 01:23:08,560
do not possess legally binding force. In 2025, NHRC's operational budget was slashed by over

760
01:23:08,560 --> 01:23:15,380
96 percent by the Legislative Yuan. The 2026 budget and nominations for the new term of

761
01:23:15,380 --> 01:23:20,520
commissioners have yet to pass review by the Legislative Yuan. The Legislative Yuan is

