I think I would like to ask the Ministry of Justice to explain that about this comprehensive anti-discrimination legislation.

1563
04:26:30,459 --> 04:26:34,040
We would like to ask the NHRC to talk about that.

1564
04:26:34,040 --> 04:26:41,079
And for the Control Yuan, NHRC issues, we would like to ask NHRC to answer those questions.

1565
