And also we would like to ask the Ministry of Justice to talk about the citation of CEDAWs.

1568
04:27:20,719 --> 04:27:28,100
So these are the points we would like to ask colleagues in respective departments to answer.

1569
04:27:28,540 --> 04:27:29,040
Thank you.

1570
04:27:31,659 --> 04:27:42,399
So Department of Gender Equality representative, so about this question, Section Chief Wang,

1571
04:27:42,760 --> 04:27:49,479
so about the enforcement domestically, about the CEDAW enforcement, Article 8,

1572
04:27:49,600 --> 04:27:56,159
we asked all the government agencies to review all the existing regulations, whether they are in compliance with CEDAW.

1573
04:27:56,159 --> 04:28:02,899
So for those that do not, then there are limited time frame for correction or abolition.

1574
04:28:03,520 --> 04:28:11,159
And for the enforcement of CEDAW law, now we also have a review mechanism for CEDAW enforcement.

1575
04:28:11,520 --> 04:28:22,579
So in practice and also for the new regulations in the making that I think the new regulations are not in conflict with CEDAW.

1576
04:28:22,579 --> 04:28:29,360
But for the past regulations, we did identify some of the regulations that do not comply with CEDAW.

1577
04:28:29,600 --> 04:28:34,500
So on regular basis, we will review them. So that is included in our action plan.

1578
04:28:34,700 --> 04:28:41,059
We asked the corresponding government agencies to complete that correction within certain time frame.

1579
04:28:41,379 --> 04:28:50,000
As for the legal status of CEDAW, since it's already internalized as a enforced law, then it's a domestic law right now.

1580
04:28:50,000 --> 04:28:56,139
And according to international human rights conventions, because it's a universal human rights norm,

1581
04:28:56,459 --> 04:29:05,979
therefore in practice that in terms of constitution that can be applied to the substance of our constitutional human rights protection,

1582
04:29:06,319 --> 04:29:14,120
our grand justices and also the Ministry of Justice can apply CEDAW and cite CEDAW for their work.

1583
04:29:14,479 --> 04:29:16,559
That concludes my answer. Thank you.

1584
04:29:16,559 --> 04:29:25,620
Thank you. And we talked about the Legislative Yuan. We're going to pass the floor to Legislative Yuan.

